[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H1FWMC-107
TITLE: Operation 07: Operational Point Setup 2
STATEMENT: >>>
When an emission is interrupted and resumed, verify the same scalar kV setpoint is reached
before the resumed emission.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
1. The system is ready with a scalar emission
2. The emission can be stopped before completion
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Beam On and stop during emission
2. Reconfirm and release the same remaining emission
3. Check the kV reading before the resumed Beam On
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. Verify the same scalar remaining time is retained
2. Verify the kV reading is within 5% of target before resumed emission
3. Verify completion transitions to Discharge
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H1FWMC-20
  ROLE: Verifies

